repository-code: https://github.com/OleBo/memristive-pseudospectral
abstract: >-
  Independent computational study of local pseudospectral stability and
  trajectory-dependent transient amplification in self-organizing memristive
  networks, using analytic Jacobians and a source-aligned random-projector
  construction.
